    <string name="panel_service_desc">Opens the launcher\'s Quick panel instead of the phone\'s own panel when you pull down the status bar in any app. It places an invisible bar over the status bar to catch the pull-down, and takes a picture of the screen only to blur it behind the panel (the picture is never saved or sent). To switch Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, mobile data and the other buttons in one tap, it opens the phone\'s own Quick settings for a moment, finds the button by its name and presses it for you. It reads nothing else on your screen.</string>
